<%# Placeholder for the Session hierarchy and Human messages panels while their
    frame is in flight.

    Two summary rows and an indented outline, sized like _session_hierarchy's
    own: a 3-row-deep tree under an expanded first disclosure, then a collapsed
    second row. That is the shape the loaded panel has for the ordinary session,
    so the swap does not push the Transcript disclosure below it up or down.

    Carries no id, on purpose: #session_<id>_provenance is a
    data-live-region="replace" region, and if this skeleton answered to that id a
    reconnect backfill fetching the page (whose frame is unloaded) would replace
    the reader's real hierarchy with grey bars. Without the id the backfill finds
    no source element and leaves the live one alone. %>
<div class="divide-y divide-gray-200" role="status" aria-busy="true" aria-label="Loading session hierarchy">
  <span class="sr-only">Loading session hierarchy…</span>

  <div class="animate-pulse">
    <div class="px-4 sm:px-6 py-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
      <span class="flex items-center gap-2 min-w-0">
        <div class="h-4 w-4 rounded bg-gray-200 flex-shrink-0"></div>
        <div class="h-3.5 w-32 rounded bg-gray-200"></div>
        <div class="h-3 w-40 rounded bg-gray-100 hidden sm:block"></div>
      </span>
      <div class="h-3 w-44 rounded bg-gray-100 hidden sm:block"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="border-t border-gray-200 px-4 sm:px-6 py-3 space-y-2">
      <%# Depth and width are separate columns rather than one indexed by the
          other: two rows share a depth, and indexing the widths by it would give
          them the same bar — the column of identical bars a skeleton is trying
          not to be. %>
      <% [ [ 0, "w-2/5" ], [ 1, "w-1/3" ], [ 2, "w-1/2" ], [ 2, "w-1/4" ] ].each do |depth, width| %>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2" style="padding-left: <%= depth * 20 %>px">
          <div class="h-3 w-10 rounded bg-gray-200 flex-shrink-0"></div>
          <div class="h-3 <%= width %> rounded bg-gray-100"></div>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="animate-pulse px-4 sm:px-6 py-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
    <span class="flex items-center gap-2 min-w-0">
      <div class="h-4 w-4 rounded bg-gray-200 flex-shrink-0"></div>
      <div class="h-3.5 w-28 rounded bg-gray-200"></div>
    </span>
    <div class="h-3 w-36 rounded bg-gray-100 hidden sm:block"></div>
  </div>
</div>
